# Library Inventory Management System

A menu-driven **Library Inventory Management System** developed in **Python** as a group assignment for the **Bano Qabil Digital Skills Program**.

## 📖 Project Overview

This project demonstrates the use of fundamental Python programming concepts by creating a simple library management system. It allows users to manage a collection of books, borrow and return books, search the inventory, and store data in a file.

## ✨ Features

- Add new books
- Search books by Book ID
- Borrow books
- Return books
- Display all books
- View available books
- Save inventory to a file
- Load inventory from a file

## 🛠️ Python Concepts Used

- Functions
- Lists
- Dictionaries
- Tuples
- Loops
- Conditional Statements
- Boolean Values
- Strings
- Numbers
- File Handling

